    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.poster.avif?t=1755092325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.webm?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.mp4?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The citizens of the island live a quiet life. Maybe a little too quiet...<br><br>Until you arrive. A curious and chaotic seagull with complete freedom to roam, explore, and cause a bit of trouble.<br><br>Will you help the locals... or drive them mad?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/e253ee5217ff6edc707d93d9b485d4f7.poster.avif?t=1755092325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/e253ee5217ff6edc707d93d9b485d4f7.webm?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fly freely around a vibrant island where nearly everything is interactive<br></li><li>Tease, prank, or assist citizens based on your mood<br></li><li>Solve playful challenges and uncover island secrets<br></li><li>Help animals in need and cross paths with them in unexpected ways<br></li><li>Go on treasure hunts by following maps and digging up hidden spots<br></li><li>Investigate a strange pollution threatening the island and try to fix it<br></li><li>Enjoy dynamic music that adapts to your behavior<br></li><li>Change the world, literally, through your actions<br></li><li>Or just perch on a bench and watch the world go by</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.poster.avif?t=1755092325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.webm?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Goeland is a peaceful-yet-mischievous sandbox adventure where exploration, humor, and emergent gameplay collide.<br><br>Not a fan of chaos? Goeland lets you dial down the drama: disable chases, chill out, and just enjoy being a peaceful little bird.<br><br>What kind of seagull will you be?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.poster.avif?t=1755092325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.webm?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
