go by</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.poster.avif?t=1755092325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.webm?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Goeland is a peaceful-yet-mischievous sandbox adventure where exploration, humor, and emergent gameplay collide.<br><br>Not a fan of chaos? Goeland lets you dial down the drama: disable chases, chill out, and just enjoy being a peaceful little bird.<br><br>What kind of seagull will you be?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.poster.avif?t=1755092325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.webm?t=1755092325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re a seagull. The island is your playground. Adventure awaits, if you're not too busy being a menace.",
